      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "TriggerFish Slop4 playable smoke test\n\nSETUP\nSelect MIDI and audio devices in MIDI-CV and Audio-8. Start with monitor volume low.\n\nMIDI pitch -> Slop4 -> four Fundamental VCOs -> VCA Mix -> TriggerFish VCA. MIDI gate drives the ADSR. Two oscillators are at unison and two are one octave higher.\n\nAll TriggerFish parameters are at their declared defaults. The final VCA Mix is the master, set to -6 dB and routed to outputs 1/2."
      },
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
